sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Direccion
  participant S2 as S2 CalendarioAcademico
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant S4 as S4 Becas
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Direccion->>S2: MarcarPeriodoActual(codigoPeriodo)
  S2->>DB: Commit periodo + Outbox
  S2->>MQ: PeriodoMarcadoActual.v1
  MQ->>S4: Evento
  loop Paginado e idempotente por BecaId y Periodo
    S4->>S4: Beca.IniciarNuevoPeriodo()
    S4->>DB: Guardar con versión + RegistroDecision + Outbox
  end
  S4-->>MQ: Confirmar consumo
